{"seq":3,"slug":"thread-implementation","title":"线程的实现机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/threads/thread-implementation","wordCount":1595,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"线程的实现机制\">线程的实现机制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>线程的实现围绕四个环节展开：<strong>创建</strong>、<strong>调度</strong>、<strong>同步</strong>与<strong>生命周期管理</strong>。其中调度与同步是决定多线程程序正确性与性能的两个核心环节。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n<th>关键权衡</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>创建</strong></td>\n<td>分配 TCB、分配栈、初始化上下文、加入调度队列</td>\n<td>用户级无需系统调用，内核级可被内核感知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>调度</strong></td>\n<td>内核级调度、用户级调度</td>\n<td>切换速度 vs 多核利用与抢占能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>同步</strong></td>\n<td>互斥锁、信号量、条件变量、屏障</td>\n<td>保护强度 vs 阻塞与性能开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>生命周期</strong></td>\n<td>join、detach、cancel</td>\n<td>是否需要结果、是否需要确保完成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  C[&quot;创建&lt;br/&gt;TCB + 栈 + 初始上下文&quot;] --&gt; S[&quot;调度&lt;br/&gt;内核级 / 用户级&quot;]&#10;  S --&gt; Y[&quot;同步&lt;br/&gt;互斥锁 / 信号量 / 条件变量 / 屏障&quot;]&#10;  Y --&gt; L[&quot;生命周期&lt;br/&gt;join / detach / cancel&quot;]\">graph LR\n  C[\"创建&lt;br/&gt;TCB + 栈 + 初始上下文\"] --&gt; S[\"调度&lt;br/&gt;内核级 / 用户级\"]\n  S --&gt; Y[\"同步&lt;br/&gt;互斥锁 / 信号量 / 条件变量 / 屏障\"]\n  Y --&gt; L[\"生命周期&lt;br/&gt;join / detach / cancel\"]</pre><p>一条贯穿始终的原则是：<strong>调度方式决定性能上限，同步方式决定正确性下限</strong>。用户级调度换来极快的切换，却失去了多核与抢占；同步原语越强，安全边界越清晰，但阻塞与竞争的开销也越大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"线程的创建\">线程的创建</h2><p>线程的创建方式因线程类型（用户级、内核级）和具体平台而异，但基本过程都包括：分配线程控制块（TCB）、分配独立的栈空间、设置初始上下文，然后将线程加入调度队列。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    START[&quot;Call Thread Creation API&quot;] --&gt; ALLOC[&quot;Allocate TCB&lt;br/&gt;Record Thread ID, Owning Process, etc.&quot;]&#10;    ALLOC --&gt; STACK[&quot;Allocate Independent Stack Space&quot;]&#10;    STACK --&gt; INIT[&quot;Initialize Context&lt;br/&gt;Set PC to Thread Function Entry&lt;br/&gt;Set Initial Registers and Stack Pointer&quot;]&#10;    INIT --&gt; QUEUE[&quot;Add Thread to Ready Queue&quot;]&#10;    QUEUE --&gt; READY[&quot;Thread Enters Ready State&lt;br/&gt;Waiting to Be Scheduled&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    START[\"Call Thread Creation API\"] --&gt; ALLOC[\"Allocate TCB&lt;br/&gt;Record Thread ID, Owning Process, etc.\"]\n    ALLOC --&gt; STACK[\"Allocate Independent Stack Space\"]\n    STACK --&gt; INIT[\"Initialize Context&lt;br/&gt;Set PC to Thread Function Entry&lt;br/&gt;Set Initial Registers and Stack Pointer\"]\n    INIT --&gt; QUEUE[\"Add Thread to Ready Queue\"]\n    QUEUE --&gt; READY[\"Thread Enters Ready State&lt;br/&gt;Waiting to Be Scheduled\"]</pre><h3 id=\"通用线程创建模型\">通用线程创建模型</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"FUNCTION create_thread(thread_function, arguments):&#10;    tcb = allocate_TCB()&#10;    tcb.thread_id = generate_unique_id()&#10;    tcb.state = NEW&#10;    tcb.stack = allocate_stack(default_stack_size)&#10;    tcb.program_counter = address_of(thread_function)&#10;    tcb.registers = initialize_registers()&#10;    tcb.arguments = arguments&#10;&#10;    tcb.state = READY&#10;    add_to_ready_queue(tcb)&#10;&#10;    RETURN tcb.thread_id&#10;END FUNCTION\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION create_thread(thread_function, arguments):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tcb = allocate_TCB()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tcb.thread_id = generate_unique_id()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tcb.state = NEW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tcb.stack = allocate_stack(default_stack_size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tcb.program_counter = address_of(thread_function)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tcb.registers = initialize_registers()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tcb.arguments = arguments</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tcb.state = READY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    add_to_ready_queue(tcb)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    RETURN tcb.thread_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"不同环境的创建示例\">不同环境的创建示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function fetchData(url: string): Promise&lt;string&gt; {&#10;  const response = await fetch(url);&#10;  return response.text();&#10;}&#10;&#10;const worker = new Worker(&#39;worker.ts&#39;);&#10;worker.postMessage({ type: &#39;start&#39;, data: [1, 2, 3] });&#10;&#10;worker.onmessage = (event) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;收到结果:&#39;, event.data);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(url);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> worker</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Worker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'worker.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">worker.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">postMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'start'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, data: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">worker.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onmessage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'收到结果:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, event.data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在概念层面，无论使用哪种 API，线程创建的本质步骤是一致的：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>用户级线程</th>\n<th>内核级线程</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>分配 TCB</strong></td>\n<td>创建线程描述数据结构</td>\n<td>在用户空间分配</td>\n<td>在内核空间分配（需系统调用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>分配栈</strong></td>\n<td>为线程的函数调用链提供空间</td>\n<td>在用户堆上分配</td>\n<td>内核分配内核栈 + 用户栈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>初始化上下文</strong></td>\n<td>设置 PC、SP、初始参数</td>\n<td>线程库完成</td>\n<td>内核完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>加入调度</strong></td>\n<td>使线程可被选中执行</td>\n<td>加入用户级调度器队列</td>\n<td>加入内核调度器队列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"线程的调度\">线程的调度</h2><p>线程调度决定了在任意时刻哪个线程获得 CPU 执行权。根据线程类型的不同，调度可以发生在用户空间或内核空间。</p>\n<h3 id=\"内核级线程调度\">内核级线程调度</h3><p>内核级线程由操作系统内核直接调度，调度策略与进程调度类似（优先级、时间片轮转等），但调度粒度更细。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph KernelScheduler[&quot;OS Kernel Scheduler&quot;]&#10;        direction TB&#10;        RQ[&quot;Ready Queue&quot;]&#10;        RQ --&gt; SEL{&quot;Select Next Thread&quot;}&#10;        SEL --&gt;|&quot;Highest Priority&quot;| T1[&quot;Thread A&quot;]&#10;        SEL --&gt;|&quot;Round-Robin&quot;| T2[&quot;Thread B&quot;]&#10;        SEL --&gt;|&quot;Real-Time Priority&quot;| T3[&quot;Thread C&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph CPUCores[&quot;CPU Cores&quot;]&#10;        C1[&quot;Core 1 ← Thread A&quot;]&#10;        C2[&quot;Core 2 ← Thread B&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    T1 --&gt; C1&#10;    T2 --&gt; C2\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph KernelScheduler[\"OS Kernel Scheduler\"]\n        direction TB\n        RQ[\"Ready Queue\"]\n        RQ --&gt; SEL{\"Select Next Thread\"}\n        SEL --&gt;|\"Highest Priority\"| T1[\"Thread A\"]\n        SEL --&gt;|\"Round-Robin\"| T2[\"Thread B\"]\n        SEL --&gt;|\"Real-Time Priority\"| T3[\"Thread C\"]\n    end\n    subgraph CPUCores[\"CPU Cores\"]\n        C1[\"Core 1 ← Thread A\"]\n        C2[\"Core 2 ← Thread B\"]\n    end\n    T1 --&gt; C1\n    T2 --&gt; C2</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"FUNCTION kernel_thread_scheduler():&#10;    LOOP:&#10;        IF timer_interrupt OR thread_blocked OR thread_yield THEN&#10;            current = get_current_thread()&#10;            save_context(current)&#10;            current.state = READY  // 或 BLOCKED&#10;            add_to_ready_queue(current)&#10;&#10;            next = pick_next_thread(ready_queue)  // 按调度策略选择&#10;            remove_from_ready_queue(next)&#10;            next.state = RUNNING&#10;            restore_context(next)&#10;            switch_to(next)&#10;        END IF&#10;    END LOOP&#10;END FUNCTION\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION kernel_thread_scheduler():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    LOOP:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        IF timer_interrupt OR thread_blocked OR thread_yield THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            current = get_current_thread()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            save_context(current)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            current.state = READY  // 或 BLOCKED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            add_to_ready_queue(current)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            next = pick_next_thread(ready_queue)  // 按调度策略选择</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            remove_from_ready_queue(next)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            next.state = RUNNING</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            restore_context(next)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            switch_to(next)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        END IF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    END LOOP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"用户级线程调度\">用户级线程调度</h3><p>用户级线程由用户空间的线程库自行调度，内核对此毫不知情。调度发生在用户态，切换速度更快，但无法利用多核。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph UserSpaceScheduling[&quot;User-Space Thread Library&quot;]&#10;        direction TB&#10;        URQ[&quot;User-Level Ready Queue&quot;]&#10;        URQ --&gt; USEL{&quot;Thread Library Scheduler&quot;}&#10;        USEL --&gt; UT1[&quot;User Thread 1&quot;]&#10;        USEL --&gt; UT2[&quot;User Thread 2&quot;]&#10;        USEL --&gt; UT3[&quot;User Thread 3&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph KernelView[&quot;Kernel View&quot;]&#10;        KT[&quot;Sees Only One Kernel Thread&lt;br/&gt;(Hosting All User Threads)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    UserSpaceScheduling --&gt;|&quot;Mapped to Single Kernel Thread&quot;| KernelView\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph UserSpaceScheduling[\"User-Space Thread Library\"]\n        direction TB\n        URQ[\"User-Level Ready Queue\"]\n        URQ --&gt; USEL{\"Thread Library Scheduler\"}\n        USEL --&gt; UT1[\"User Thread 1\"]\n        USEL --&gt; UT2[\"User Thread 2\"]\n        USEL --&gt; UT3[\"User Thread 3\"]\n    end\n    subgraph KernelView[\"Kernel View\"]\n        KT[\"Sees Only One Kernel Thread&lt;br/&gt;(Hosting All User Threads)\"]\n    end\n    UserSpaceScheduling --&gt;|\"Mapped to Single Kernel Thread\"| KernelView</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"FUNCTION user_thread_scheduler():&#10;    LOOP:&#10;        current = get_current_user_thread()&#10;        IF current.yielded OR current.blocked THEN&#10;            save_user_context(current)&#10;            next = pick_next_from_user_queue()&#10;            restore_user_context(next)&#10;            jump_to(next.program_counter)&#10;        END IF&#10;    END LOOP&#10;END FUNCTION\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION user_thread_scheduler():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    LOOP:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        current = get_current_user_thread()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        IF current.yielded OR current.blocked THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            save_user_context(current)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            next = pick_next_from_user_queue()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            restore_user_context(next)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            jump_to(next.program_counter)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        END IF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    END LOOP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"调度方式对比\">调度方式对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>内核级调度</th>\n<th>用户级调度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>调度主体</strong></td>\n<td>操作系统内核</td>\n<td>用户空间线程库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>切换方式</strong></td>\n<td>需要内核态 ↔ 用户态切换</td>\n<td>完全在用户态完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>切换速度</strong></td>\n<td>较慢（涉及系统调用）</td>\n<td>快（无系统调用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>多核利用</strong></td>\n<td>可以将线程分配到不同核心</td>\n<td>无法利用多核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>阻塞影响</strong></td>\n<td>一个线程阻塞不影响其他线程</td>\n<td>一个线程阻塞导致整个进程阻塞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>抢占能力</strong></td>\n<td>支持抢占式调度</td>\n<td>通常只支持协作式调度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"线程同步机制\">线程同步机制</h2><p>当多个线程共享资源时，必须使用<strong>同步机制</strong>来保证数据一致性和执行顺序的正确性。以下是四种最基本的同步原语。</p>\n<h3 id=\"锁-mutex-互斥锁\">锁（Mutex / 互斥锁）</h3><p>互斥锁是最基本的同步机制，保证在任意时刻最多只有一个线程进入<strong>临界区</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"mutex = create_mutex()&#10;&#10;FUNCTION thread_safe_increment():&#10;    lock(mutex)&#10;    // ─── 临界区开始 ───&#10;    shared_counter = shared_counter + 1&#10;    // ─── 临界区结束 ───&#10;    unlock(mutex)&#10;END FUNCTION\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>mutex = create_mutex()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION thread_safe_increment():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    lock(mutex)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // ─── 临界区开始 ───</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    shared_counter = shared_counter + 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // ─── 临界区结束 ───</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    unlock(mutex)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant TA as Thread A&#10;    participant M as Mutex&#10;    participant TB as Thread B&#10;&#10;    TA-&gt;&gt;M: lock() - Acquire Lock ✓&#10;    Note over TA: Enter Critical Section&#10;    TB-&gt;&gt;M: lock() - Lock Held, Blocked Waiting&#10;    TA-&gt;&gt;M: unlock() - Release Lock&#10;    M-&gt;&gt;TB: Wake Up - Acquire Lock ✓&#10;    Note over TB: Enter Critical Section&#10;    TB-&gt;&gt;M: unlock() - Release Lock\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant TA as Thread A\n    participant M as Mutex\n    participant TB as Thread B\n\n    TA-&gt;&gt;M: lock() - Acquire Lock ✓\n    Note over TA: Enter Critical Section\n    TB-&gt;&gt;M: lock() - Lock Held, Blocked Waiting\n    TA-&gt;&gt;M: unlock() - Release Lock\n    M-&gt;&gt;TB: Wake Up - Acquire Lock ✓\n    Note over TB: Enter Critical Section\n    TB-&gt;&gt;M: unlock() - Release Lock</pre><h3 id=\"信号量-semaphore\">信号量（Semaphore）</h3><p>信号量是一个维护<strong>计数器</strong>的同步原语，可以控制同时访问某资源的线程数量。互斥锁是计数器为 1 的特殊信号量。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 信号量：允许最多 3 个线程同时访问&#10;semaphore = create_semaphore(initial_value: 3)&#10;&#10;FUNCTION access_limited_resource(thread_id):&#10;    wait(semaphore)     // P 操作：计数器 - 1，若 &lt; 0 则阻塞&#10;    print(thread_id, &quot;正在访问资源&quot;)&#10;    use_resource()&#10;    signal(semaphore)   // V 操作：计数器 + 1，唤醒等待者&#10;END FUNCTION\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 信号量：允许最多 3 个线程同时访问</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>semaphore = create_semaphore(initial_value: 3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION access_limited_resource(thread_id):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    wait(semaphore)     // P 操作：计数器 - 1，若 &#x3C; 0 则阻塞</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    print(thread_id, \"正在访问资源\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    use_resource()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    signal(semaphore)   // V 操作：计数器 + 1，唤醒等待者</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"条件变量-condition-variable\">条件变量（Condition Variable）</h3><p>条件变量允许线程在某个条件不满足时<strong>挂起等待</strong>，当条件满足时被其他线程<strong>唤醒</strong>。通常与互斥锁配合使用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"mutex = create_mutex()&#10;cond = create_condition_variable()&#10;queue = []&#10;&#10;// 生产者&#10;FUNCTION producer(item):&#10;    lock(mutex)&#10;    queue.push(item)&#10;    signal(cond)        // 通知消费者：有新数据了&#10;    unlock(mutex)&#10;END FUNCTION&#10;&#10;// 消费者&#10;FUNCTION consumer():&#10;    lock(mutex)&#10;    WHILE queue is empty:&#10;        wait(cond, mutex) // 释放锁并等待通知，被唤醒后重新获取锁&#10;    END WHILE&#10;    item = queue.pop()&#10;    unlock(mutex)&#10;    RETURN item&#10;END FUNCTION\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>mutex = create_mutex()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>cond = create_condition_variable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>queue = []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 生产者</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION producer(item):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    lock(mutex)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    queue.push(item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    signal(cond)        // 通知消费者：有新数据了</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    unlock(mutex)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 消费者</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION consumer():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    lock(mutex)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    WHILE queue is empty:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        wait(cond, mutex) // 释放锁并等待通知，被唤醒后重新获取锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    END WHILE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    item = queue.pop()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    unlock(mutex)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    RETURN item</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant P as Producer Thread&#10;    participant Q as Shared Queue&#10;    participant C as Consumer Thread&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;Q: Check Queue - Empty&#10;    Note over C: wait(cond) Suspend Waiting&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;Q: push(data)&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;C: signal(cond) Wake Up&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;Q: pop(data)&#10;    Note over C: Process Data\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant P as Producer Thread\n    participant Q as Shared Queue\n    participant C as Consumer Thread\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;Q: Check Queue - Empty\n    Note over C: wait(cond) Suspend Waiting\n    P-&gt;&gt;Q: push(data)\n    P-&gt;&gt;C: signal(cond) Wake Up\n    C-&gt;&gt;Q: pop(data)\n    Note over C: Process Data</pre><h3 id=\"屏障-barrier\">屏障（Barrier）</h3><p>屏障要求一组线程<strong>全部到达</strong>某个同步点后才能继续执行，常用于并行计算中阶段之间的同步。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"barrier = create_barrier(thread_count: 4)&#10;&#10;FUNCTION parallel_task(thread_id):&#10;    // 阶段 1：各线程独立计算&#10;    result = compute_phase_1(thread_id)&#10;&#10;    wait_at_barrier(barrier)  // 等待所有 4 个线程都到达此处&#10;&#10;    // 阶段 2：所有线程同步完成后才继续&#10;    compute_phase_2(thread_id, all_results)&#10;END FUNCTION\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>barrier = create_barrier(thread_count: 4)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION parallel_task(thread_id):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 阶段 1：各线程独立计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result = compute_phase_1(thread_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    wait_at_barrier(barrier)  // 等待所有 4 个线程都到达此处</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 阶段 2：所有线程同步完成后才继续</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    compute_phase_2(thread_id, all_results)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Phase1[&quot;Phase 1 (Independent Computation)&quot;]&#10;        T1A[&quot;Thread 1 Compute&quot;]&#10;        T2A[&quot;Thread 2 Compute&quot;]&#10;        T3A[&quot;Thread 3 Compute&quot;]&#10;        T4A[&quot;Thread 4 Compute&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph BARRIER[&quot;Barrier Synchronization Point&quot;]&#10;        B[&quot;All Threads Must Arrive Before Proceeding&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Phase2[&quot;Phase 2 (Continue After Sync)&quot;]&#10;        T1B[&quot;Thread 1 Continue&quot;]&#10;        T2B[&quot;Thread 2 Continue&quot;]&#10;        T3B[&quot;Thread 3 Continue&quot;]&#10;        T4B[&quot;Thread 4 Continue&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    T1A --&gt; B&#10;    T2A --&gt; B&#10;    T3A --&gt; B&#10;    T4A --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; T1B&#10;    B --&gt; T2B&#10;    B --&gt; T3B&#10;    B --&gt; T4B\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Phase1[\"Phase 1 (Independent Computation)\"]\n        T1A[\"Thread 1 Compute\"]\n        T2A[\"Thread 2 Compute\"]\n        T3A[\"Thread 3 Compute\"]\n        T4A[\"Thread 4 Compute\"]\n    end\n    subgraph BARRIER[\"Barrier Synchronization Point\"]\n        B[\"All Threads Must Arrive Before Proceeding\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Phase2[\"Phase 2 (Continue After Sync)\"]\n        T1B[\"Thread 1 Continue\"]\n        T2B[\"Thread 2 Continue\"]\n        T3B[\"Thread 3 Continue\"]\n        T4B[\"Thread 4 Continue\"]\n    end\n    T1A --&gt; B\n    T2A --&gt; B\n    T3A --&gt; B\n    T4A --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; T1B\n    B --&gt; T2B\n    B --&gt; T3B\n    B --&gt; T4B</pre><h3 id=\"同步机制对比\">同步机制对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>同步机制</th>\n<th>核心功能</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>性能影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>互斥锁（Mutex）</strong></td>\n<td>保证互斥访问临界区</td>\n<td>保护共享变量</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中（可能引起线程阻塞）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>信号量（Semaphore）</strong></td>\n<td>控制并发访问数量</td>\n<td>限流、资源池</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>条件变量（Condition）</strong></td>\n<td>按条件等待和通知</td>\n<td>生产者-消费者模式</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低（精确唤醒，减少无效等待）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>屏障（Barrier）</strong></td>\n<td>全部到达后才继续</td>\n<td>并行计算阶段同步</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（所有线程需等待最慢者）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"同步机制的选择策略\">同步机制的选择策略</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Q1{&quot;What Type of Synchronization Is Needed?&quot;}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|&quot;Mutual Exclusion on Shared Data&quot;| A1[&quot;Use Mutex&quot;]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|&quot;Limit Concurrent Access Count&quot;| A2[&quot;Use Semaphore&quot;]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|&quot;Wait for Specific Condition&quot;| A3[&quot;Use Condition Variable + Mutex&quot;]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|&quot;Multi-Thread Phase Synchronization&quot;| A4[&quot;Use Barrier&quot;]&#10;    A1 --&gt; NOTE1[&quot;Most Common, Ensures Only One Thread Enters Critical Section&quot;]&#10;    A2 --&gt; NOTE2[&quot;Suitable for Resource Pools, Connection Pools&quot;]&#10;    A3 --&gt; NOTE3[&quot;Suitable for Producer-Consumer, Event-Driven&quot;]&#10;    A4 --&gt; NOTE4[&quot;Suitable for Phased Parallel Computation&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    Q1{\"What Type of Synchronization Is Needed?\"}\n    Q1 --&gt;|\"Mutual Exclusion on Shared Data\"| A1[\"Use Mutex\"]\n    Q1 --&gt;|\"Limit Concurrent Access Count\"| A2[\"Use Semaphore\"]\n    Q1 --&gt;|\"Wait for Specific Condition\"| A3[\"Use Condition Variable + Mutex\"]\n    Q1 --&gt;|\"Multi-Thread Phase Synchronization\"| A4[\"Use Barrier\"]\n    A1 --&gt; NOTE1[\"Most Common, Ensures Only One Thread Enters Critical Section\"]\n    A2 --&gt; NOTE2[\"Suitable for Resource Pools, Connection Pools\"]\n    A3 --&gt; NOTE3[\"Suitable for Producer-Consumer, Event-Driven\"]\n    A4 --&gt; NOTE4[\"Suitable for Phased Parallel Computation\"]</pre><h2 id=\"线程的生命周期管理\">线程的生命周期管理</h2><h3 id=\"线程的终止\">线程的终止</h3><p>线程可以通过以下方式终止：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 方式 1：线程函数正常返回&#10;FUNCTION thread_task():&#10;    do_work()&#10;    RETURN result  // 线程自然结束&#10;&#10;// 方式 2：线程主动退出&#10;FUNCTION thread_task_with_exit():&#10;    IF should_stop THEN&#10;        thread_exit(0)&#10;    END IF&#10;&#10;// 方式 3：被其他线程取消&#10;FUNCTION cancel_thread(target_thread):&#10;    request_cancel(target_thread)&#10;    // 目标线程在下一个取消点检查并退出\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 方式 1：线程函数正常返回</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION thread_task():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    do_work()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    RETURN result  // 线程自然结束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 方式 2：线程主动退出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION thread_task_with_exit():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    IF should_stop THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        thread_exit(0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    END IF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 方式 3：被其他线程取消</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION cancel_thread(target_thread):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    request_cancel(target_thread)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 目标线程在下一个取消点检查并退出</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"线程的合并-join\">线程的合并（Join）</h3><p>父线程（或创建者线程）可以调用 <code>join</code> 等待子线程完成，并获取其返回值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"FUNCTION main():&#10;    t1 = create_thread(compute, data1)&#10;    t2 = create_thread(compute, data2)&#10;&#10;    result1 = join(t1)  // 阻塞直到 t1 完成&#10;    result2 = join(t2)  // 阻塞直到 t2 完成&#10;&#10;    final_result = combine(result1, result2)&#10;END FUNCTION\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION main():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    t1 = create_thread(compute, data1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    t2 = create_thread(compute, data2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result1 = join(t1)  // 阻塞直到 t1 完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result2 = join(t2)  // 阻塞直到 t2 完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final_result = combine(result1, result2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"线程的分离-detach\">线程的分离（Detach）</h3><p>如果不需要等待线程完成或获取其返回值，可以将线程<strong>分离</strong>，让操作系统在线程结束时自动回收资源：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"FUNCTION fire_and_forget():&#10;    t = create_thread(background_task)&#10;    detach(t)  // 不再等待，线程结束后自动清理&#10;END FUNCTION\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION fire_and_forget():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    t = create_thread(background_task)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    detach(t)  // 不再等待，线程结束后自动清理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>管理方式</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Join</strong></td>\n<td>等待线程结束并回收资源</td>\n<td>需要线程结果、需要确保线程完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Detach</strong></td>\n<td>线程独立运行，结束后自动回收</td>\n<td>后台任务、日志写入等不关心结果的场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Cancel</strong></td>\n<td>请求终止目标线程</td>\n<td>超时取消、用户中断操作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>线程创建的核心步骤包括分配 TCB、分配栈空间、初始化上下文、加入调度队列，用户级和内核级线程在分配位置和是否需要系统调用上有所不同。</li>\n<li>线程调度分为内核级调度（由 OS 内核管理，可利用多核，支持抢占）和用户级调度（由线程库管理，切换快但无法利用多核），两者各有优劣。</li>\n<li>线程同步的四种基本机制——<strong>互斥锁</strong>（互斥访问）、<strong>信号量</strong>（控制并发数）、<strong>条件变量</strong>（条件等待）、<strong>屏障</strong>（阶段同步）——是构建正确多线程程序的基石。</li>\n<li>线程的生命周期管理（join、detach、cancel）决定了线程资源的回收方式，需根据业务场景选择合适的策略。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"线程的实现机制","id":"线程的实现机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"线程的创建","id":"线程的创建"},{"level":3,"text":"通用线程创建模型","id":"通用线程创建模型"},{"level":3,"text":"不同环境的创建示例","id":"不同环境的创建示例"},{"level":2,"text":"线程的调度","id":"线程的调度"},{"level":3,"text":"内核级线程调度","id":"内核级线程调度"},{"level":3,"text":"用户级线程调度","id":"用户级线程调度"},{"level":3,"text":"调度方式对比","id":"调度方式对比"},{"level":2,"text":"线程同步机制","id":"线程同步机制"},{"level":3,"text":"锁（Mutex / 互斥锁）","id":"锁-mutex-互斥锁"},{"level":3,"text":"信号量（Semaphore）","id":"信号量-semaphore"},{"level":3,"text":"条件变量（Condition Variable）","id":"条件变量-condition-variable"},{"level":3,"text":"屏障（Barrier）","id":"屏障-barrier"},{"level":3,"text":"同步机制对比","id":"同步机制对比"},{"level":3,"text":"同步机制的选择策略","id":"同步机制的选择策略"},{"level":2,"text":"线程的生命周期管理","id":"线程的生命周期管理"},{"level":3,"text":"线程的终止","id":"线程的终止"},{"level":3,"text":"线程的合并（Join）","id":"线程的合并-join"},{"level":3,"text":"线程的分离（Detach）","id":"线程的分离-detach"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"线程的核心思想","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/threads/thread-core-ideas"},"next":{"title":"协程的定义与核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/coroutines/coroutine-definition-and-concepts"}}